<span begin="00:23.770" end="00:23.980">We </span><span begin="00:23.980" end="00:24.550">show </span><span begin="00:24.550" end="00:25.840">off </span><span begin="00:25.840" end="00:26.020">our </span><span begin="00:26.020" end="00:26.500">different </span><span begin="00:26.500" end="00:26.950">scarlet </span><span begin="00:26.950" end="00:27.760">letters</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.880" end="00:30.520"><span begin="00:27.880" end="00:28.330">Trust </span><span begin="00:28.330" end="00:28.480">me</span><span begin="00:28.480" end="00:28.480">, </span><span begin="00:28.480" end="00:28.810">mine </span><span begin="00:28.810" end="00:28.900">is </span><span begin="00:28.900" end="00:30.520">better</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.600" end="00:35.470"><span begin="00:31.600" end="00:31.870">We're </span><span begin="00:31.870" end="00:32.320">so </span><span begin="00:32.320" end="00:33.520">young </span><span begin="00:33.520" end="00:33.700">but </span><span begin="00:33.700" end="00:33.940">we're </span><span begin="00:33.940" end="00:34.210">on </span><span begin="00:34.210" end="00:34.420">the </span><span begin="00:34.420" end="00:34.660">road </span><span begin="00:34.660" end="00:34.840">to </span><span begin="00:34.840" end="00:35.470">ruin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.590" end="00:36.940"><span begin="00:35.590" end="00:35.830">We </span><span begin="00:35.830" end="00:36.250">play </span><span begin="00:36.250" end="00:36.940">dumb</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.060" end="00:39.400"><span begin="00:37.060" end="00:37.180">But </span><span begin="00:37.180" end="00:37.300">we </span><span begin="00:37.300" end="00:37.660">know </span><span begin="00:37.660" end="00:38.320">exactly </span><span begin="00:38.320" end="00:38.590">what </span><span begin="00:38.590" end="00:38.800">we're </span><span begin="00:38.800" end="00:39.400">doing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.550" end="00:41.200"><span begin=