egin="01:23.590" end="01:23.890">noise </span><span begin="01:23.890" end="01:23.980">are </span><span begin="01:23.980" end="01:24.670">blinding</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.790" end="01:26.650"><span begin="01:24.790" end="01:25.060">We </span><span begin="01:25.060" end="01:25.540">hang </span><span begin="01:25.540" end="01:26.650">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.010" end="01:28.450"><span begin="01:27.010" end="01:27.340">It's </span><span begin="01:27.340" end="01:27.580">all </span><span begin="01:27.580" end="01:27.790">in </span><span begin="01:27.790" end="01:27.940">the </span><span begin="01:27.940" end="01:28.450">timing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.720" end="01:32.260"><span begin="01:28.720" end="01:28.990">It's </span><span begin="01:28.990" end="01:30.220">poker</span><span begin="01:30.220" end="01:30.250">, </span><span begin="01:30.250" end="01:30.640">He </span><span begin="01:30.640" end="01:30.970">can't </span><span begin="01:30.970" end="01:31.240">see </span><span begin="01:31.240" end="01:31.480">it </span><span begin="01:31.480" end="01:31.630">in </span><span begin="01:31.630" end="01:31.810">my </span><span begin="01:31.810" end="01:32.260">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.260" end="01:34.570"><span begin="01:32.260" end="01:32.500">But </span><span begin="01:32.500" end="01:32.710">I'm </span><span begin="01:32.710" end="01:33.190">about </span><span begin="01:33.190" end="01:33.370">to </span><span begin="01:33.370" end="01:33.640">play </span><span begin="01:33.640" end="01:33.940">my </span><span begin="01:33.940" end="01:34.570">ace</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.550" end="01:40.390"><span begin="01:36.550" end="01:36.820">We </span><span begin="01:36.820" end="01:37.270">need </span><span begin="01:37.270" end="01:38.410">love</span><span begin="01:38.410" end="01:38.560">, </span><span begin="01:38.560" end="01:38.830">but </span><span begin="01:38.830" end="01:39.130">